u said you didn't have a command module, SOP-II?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No...but I've picked up a thing or two about tactics. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"M4A1's past tactical plans and some of the Commander's mission records are saved in my neural cloud. Maybe we could refer to them when coming up with a battle plan..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's wonderful! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In the past, all we did was run logistics missions, and we're completely clueless as to what to do without a commander."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So...can we count on you for leadership?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"震屏"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Eh?! But I've never been a leader before! Besides, aren't YOU the team leader?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Technically speaking, yes...but I've got no experience, and I can't fight like you... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If you think about it, I'd probably end up leading everyone to an early grave, like just now..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Sighs) Alright then. I can't guarantee that I'll do a good job. After all, my neural cloud's computation capabilities aren't nearly as good as M4's and the others. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In that case, you'd best stay close to me, everyone. Without a command module I can't give orders via command access, so I'll sync our data up with the Zener Protocol. Just take action based on the data you get from me. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, you'd best prepare yourselves for this. Relaying messages this way is a lot more inefficient than giving direct orders. Our response time is going to be about half a beat behind S.F...."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"No problem! Everyone trusts you! Our response times were slow to begin with anyway!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't need to state that sort of thing so proudly..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Well, at least we've solved the problem of leadership. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But we're too few in number. We can't even form a defensive line."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why didn't you retreat earlier?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Our mission was to rescue our trapped friends, then retreat to a Griffin base. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"However, we lost contact with our commander just after we arrived. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"S.F. attacked us, and we had no choice but to abandon the resupply point and run, but instead we ended up being surrounded and bottled up here... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If we could save our friends while S.F. is reorganizing their formation, we might be able to salvage our defensive line..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Do you know where the trapped Dolls are?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yep! I'll mark their coordinates on your electronic map, SOP-II!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So these places, then? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm...not too sure if I can do this..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"SOP-II?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Sorry...this is my first time taking the lead like this. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In a situation like this, I don't know..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's fine. I'm honored to be fighting by your side. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If this turns out to be my last battle, then nothing would suit me better."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh? You guys...you can't back up your neural clouds?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It seems...something unexpected happened at Griffin HQ. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"We haven't been able to upload our neural cloud backups since before we met you. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"So this might be the only chance we have."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You guys... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Then...are you really prepared for this?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"(Laughs) Frankly speaking, we're not... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this might be a good thing too, the feeling of actually being remembered by someone, instead of being nothing but a set of cold, duplicated data..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Cx4...what does it feel like to be remembered?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It may sound kind of strange, but at times... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I wonder if the fact that a Doll can't die is a bad thing after all... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It's like...a curse..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A curse?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"As a logistics Doll, I often escort the operation teams into combat, and then see their bodies dragged back... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"And while they appear before me the next day, good as new, they also...forget a lot of things... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Have you ever felt that way, SOP-II?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm sorry... I can't backup my neural cloud, so I can't quite relate..."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I...I probably don't experience such feelings very often..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"PlaybackBG2","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There's no need to apologize, SOP-II! I'm not complaining about the fact that I was manufactured, but sometimes I can't help but wonder... What are we? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If the only thing that proves who I am is a chain of memories, then what about the next me? Is it just a Doll of the same model, or is she \"me\"? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Maybe if I couldn't back myself up, I wouldn't feel so confused..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Cx4..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":2,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"shake","raw":"Shake"}],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh...sorry, I went and got all sentimental! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, we're going to take good care of our bodies and everyone else's, so we need to try our best to save everyone!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Cx4...you can't just try, you know."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Cx4 Storm","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Huh?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What I mean is, you HAVE to do it!"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Cx4Storm","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"SOPIIDamage","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4 SOPMOD II","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"While I didn't understand most of what you just said, I think the rough idea is that we're all the same now! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"That definitely feels a bit more familiar to me, so that's all the motivation I needed! "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Come on, let's go and save everyone!"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"background","value":"White","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]}]}
